  "id": "D_kwDOKrJqmc4Ajoby",
  "number": 777,
  "title": "Any other ways to see when an Orbic 400L is triggered?",
  "body": "I have an Orbic 400L with a Verizon SIM card. I do not have service with Verizon so my Rayhunter instance does not have access to the internet. As such, the only way I can know about the presence of an attacker is by periodically pressing the power button to check the display.\r\n\r\nI opened the unit, hoping to find some pads on the board that I might be able to exploit for adding an LED or a vibrator, but could not find any that made sense. Anyone know if this has been investigated before?",
  "author": {
    "login": "suomi35",
    "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1065935?u=97d15b77ddca755b36e086f3bb0ea3b978e0c8f7&v=4",
