      "id": "DC_kwDOKrJqmc4A7F10",
      "body": "there's currently no way without a working SIM card. #114 was researching ways of notifying but in the end we only shipped ntfy.sh support which does require an internet connection.\r\n\r\nyou can use another device to connect to the rayhunter web UI periodically to poll for status changes. but this would require a lot of coding.",
