      "id": "DC_kwDOKrJqmc4BCtSd",
      "body": "Would it not be possible to have the webUI send push notifications on warnings? \r\nAs far as I have been able to find ntfy will not work with a prepaid sim that doesn't have a data plan. \r\nBut ideally it would be possible to be notified of hot stingrays in your area, without requiring a sim that's tied to your bank account, or staring at the mifi router all the time.",
